1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Your AC blows warm.
You assume it's just low on Freon.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,000
But if the compressor clutch never engages,
adding more refrigerant won't fix a thing.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:19,000
A low-pressure cutoff switch can shut the
compressor off on purpose, to protect it.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:27,000
A low gauge reading alone can point to a leak,
or a switch doing what it's built to do.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
That's one clue worth checking —
not a diagnosis you make from the driver's seat.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Stop by and we'll take a look
before you add anything to the system.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — save this for next time.
